{"id":"n63790-1-8","stage":2,"title":"가만히 · 静静地","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63790-1-8-1","ko":"사장님, 그러니까, 이번 일은 말이죠.","zh":"老板，那个，关于这次的事情啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사장님,","meaning":"老板，总经理","explanation":"사장：老板，总经理；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"사장","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61274","senseId":"1","lemma":"사장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사장님","audio":"/audio/ac78a86b83f1ddbafc51.mp3"}},{"text":"그러니까,","meaning":"怎么说呢（整理话头）","explanation":"그러니까：怎么说呢（整理话头）。","readings":[{"term":"그러니까","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58609","senseId":"3","lemma":"그러니까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러니까","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3"}},{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"일은","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일은","audio":"/audio/b9e5f14a07245bf00ebf.mp3"}},{"text":"말이죠.","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이죠","audio":"/audio/cf5627acbb5344dca359.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ede38c8825edb7fb","term":"사장","zh":"老板，总经理","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3","entryId":"61274","definition":"代表公司对公司事务负责的人。","pronunciation":["사장"]},{"id":"f064d1058a27cd38","term":"그러니까","zh":"怎么说呢（整理话头）","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3","entryId":"58609","definition":"怎么说呢（整理话头）","pronunciation":["그러니까"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","pronunciation":["말ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/0d087aefc811eba39d70.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63790-1-8-2","ko":"아무 말 하지 말고 가만히 내 이야기부터 들어!","zh":"什么都别说，先安静地听我把话说完！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아무","meaning":"任何，什么","explanation":"아무：任何，什么。","readings":[{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71327","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}},{"text":"말","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}},{"text":"하지","meaning":"说（말을 하다）","explanation":"말을 하다：说话；-지 말다：不要做。아무 말 하지 말고 表示什么话都不要说；하다 不表示但是或所以。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하지","audio":"/audio/e16a62e07a7c6fa42e9f.mp3"}},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"6